# Blubber Blasen for the SNES, built by dampf (superdevkit): the game and its converted data
# (build/snes/gen, written by build_snes.sh). Paths are relative to this file. The kit's part,
# its headers and its library for the SNES (lib/snes, with the main loop), is added on the
# command line by build_snes.sh, which knows SUPERDEVKIT_HOME (ADR-0007).
-I src
-I build/snes/gen
--entry main
src/game/
build/snes/gen/
